# The skill that created this directory ignores all of it by default, on the
# assumption that everything here is scratch.  Most of it is -- but the progress
# ledger and the task reports are the record of why the code looks the way it
# does, and the ledger is what lets work resume on another machine after a
# context reset.  Those are tracked; the rest still is not.
*

!.gitignore
!progress.md
!*-report.md
!final-*.md
!offline-*.md
!phase2/
phase2/*
!phase2/*-report.md
!phase3/
phase3/*
!phase3/*-report.md
